---
description: Keep viewer shortcuts from intercepting text and form input
globs: MultiImageClient/Ui/wwwroot/*.{js,html}
alwaysApply: false
---

# Viewer keyboard input safety

- Image-viewer shortcuts must not run while a higher modal dialog is open.
- They must not run when the keyboard event originates in an `input`,
  `textarea`, `select`, or content-editable element.
- The focused form/dialog owns typing, navigation, Tab, Enter, and Escape
  according to its native or explicit handlers. Never let viewer commands
  operate invisibly behind Make Video or another form.
